What method and Accept header are printed without sending a request?

```java
var request = java.net.http.HttpRequest.newBuilder(java.net.URI.create("https://example.com/expenses"))
  .timeout(java.time.Duration.ofSeconds(5))
  .header("Accept", "application/json")
  .GET()
  .build();
System.out.println(request.method());
System.out.println(request.headers().firstValue("Accept").orElse("missing"));
```
